Scope note

This licence covers the CHORD engine code in this repository: the feed
adapters, CAP normaliser, rules, store, board and tools. It does not cover
WREMO or GWRC content. The WREMO Community Emergency Hub Guide and the
Community Response Plans are copyright WREMO, all rights reserved; the GWRC
community hubs layer is licensed CC BY-NC-ND 4.0. That content is not in this
repository's current tree (older commits still contain it and are not
licensed by this file): build it locally into the gitignored corpus/ directory with
ingest_wremo.py, under the terms its owners set. The demo corpus in
node/fixtures/ is fictional.
